Hi,

I would like to stop accepting non-bug-fix patches for v4.19 on Wednesday
(tomorrow) and get the last pull requests posted by the end of this week.
This is in order for them to be sent before the release of v4.18-rc6, the
deadline set by the ARM SoC maintainers.  As patches should ideally
progress from the renesas tree into linux-next before sending pull requests
there is a few days lead time involved.

Once the tree has closed for v4.19 I intend to begin queueing up patches
for v4.20 as they are ready.
